flowchart TD
    Player["Player API: apply_player()"] --> Validate["Check public input restrictions"]
    Replay["Session: recorded action"] --> Input["apply_input(RunState, PlayerInput, Scratch)"]
    Validate --> Input

    Input --> Kind{"Input variant"}
    Kind -->|RunInput| Run["Run transition"]
    Kind -->|CombatInput| Combat["apply_combat(CombatView, ...)"]

    Run --> State["Update RunState"]
    Combat --> Sync["Synchronize HP, RNG, clock, boundary and phase"]
    Sync --> State

    State --> Return["Return one-transition result"]
    Return -->|Player API| Advance["advance_player(): resolve forced transitions"]
    Advance -->|Internal proceed| Input
    Advance --> Choice["Next player choice"]
